      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Aurora Cultural Centre Presents Mark Fewer’s ‘The Seasons’ with the [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Pricing\nRegular: $45.00 (HST included)\nStudent: $15.00 (HST included - ID Required at entry)\nTickets On Sale \nMix & Match Subscription Package: Choose 3 or more ACC shows (excluding family shows) and save 15%!  Must be done within the same transaction, discount provided at checkout.\nGreat Artist Music Series"
      }
    ],
