        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Opening Night Unearthed: My Equilibrium Thursday, May 14, 2026 | [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Opening Night\nUnearthed: My Equilibrium\nThursday, May 14, 2026 | 6:30 - 8:30 pm\nHomeroom Gallery (Level 1) | 50 Victoria Street, Aurora\n \n\nAll are welcome to celebrate the opening of Unearthed: My Equilibrium, a solo exhibition by Jing Fu, Thursday May 14, from 6:30 - 8:30pm. Light refreshments provided with remarks at 7pm."
      }
    ],
