        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Would you like to get your hands dirty and discover [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Would you like to get your hands dirty and discover the joy of working in clay? Today's your chance as we celebrate Culture Days with a free Play with Clay activity, perfect for the whole family. Join members of the Pine Tree Potters’ Guild as you learn hand-building from the best."
      }
    ],
