        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Tuesdays | 8 weeks Are you needing a weekly excuse [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Tuesdays | 8 weeks\n\nAre you needing a weekly excuse to get your paints out? Would you like to meet other visual artists in the community?\n\nOpen Studio is a friendly space available for adult creators ages 16 and up. Drop by the Centre to work on your visual arts projects in the Pine Tree Potters’ Activity"
      }
    ],
