      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "This workshop has been cancelled. Please visit the Education section of our website for more courses and workshops.\n\nTuesdays | 2 weeks\n\nA fresh take on a classic medium – watercolour painting on canvas. Over the course of two weeks, you will practice unique techniques to create vibrant pieces that are then protected with archival spray."
      }
    ],
