        "@value": "Monday-Friday\n\nThis week is starring you! Discover how art and media collide in this week’s camp. Learn about comics, cartoons, and superheroes, create a homemade camera obscura, and learn about claymation. Each week finishes with a student art exhibition for family & friends!\n\n*NEW!*\n\n\nThis week’s camp features a special guest artist in our live sessions, Marjie Chud!"
