    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Tuesday-Friday | Short Week  This week is all about fantasy, [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Tuesday-Friday | Short Week \n\nThis week is all about fantasy, myths and legends. Campers will discover how to create cool art pieces based on unicorns, dragons, mermaids, monsters, and so much more! This whimsical week will be sure to ignite your child’s imagination! Each week finishes with a student art exhibition for family & friends!\n\n*NEW!*\n\n\nThis week's"
      }
