        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Monday-Friday Delve into the styles and techniques used by some [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Monday-Friday\n\nDelve into the styles and techniques used by some of the most famous artists in history. From da Vinci to Dali, campers will learn about various mediums and experiment with recreating iconic artworks, each with their own unique flair. Each week finishes with a student art exhibition for family & friends!\n\n \nHome Is"
      }
