    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Monday-Friday  Take a voyage of discovery around the globe to [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Monday-Friday \n\nTake a voyage of discovery around the globe to learn about how different artforms have been created around the world. From Japanese ink painting to Celtic knotwork, campers will gain insight into a variety of cultures this week. Each week finishes with a student art exhibition for family & friends!\n\n \nHome Is Where"
      }
    ],
