        "@value": "Friday, January 31 | One-Day\n\nA full day of artistic adventures await! Unleash your creativity in the art studio, explore the galleries, and meet new friends in a fun and encouraging environment. Campers will be grouped off according to age range where possible.\n\nSAVE! Register two children for one PA Day program and pay $40.00/ea"
      }
