      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Mondays | 8 weeks | Class skips February 17 for Family Day\n\nLearn to carve in this accessible form or continue to shape your skills and achieve satisfying results as you create pieces in relief and in the round. Appropriate for the absolute beginner to the experienced carver. Learn safe and skillful use of the knife,"
      }
    ],
