    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "  Mondays | 8 weeks | Class skips February 17 [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Materials List \n\n \n\nMondays | 8 weeks | Class skips February 17 for Family Day\n\nSharpen your pencils and start your artistic journey! Learn all of the basics of drawing and sketching in this class, including fundamental perspective rules, composition, design, and shading. Instructional handouts and exemplars will be provided each week with exercises to guide students"
      }
    ],
