      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Saturday | One-Day\n\nLight up the winter holidays in this introductory stained glass ornament workshop. Learn all of the basics of this unique artform, including how to safely cut, grind, foil, solder, patina and polish to create your own striking festive glass art ornament that you can share with someone special this holiday season (or keep"
