      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Saturday | One-Day\n\nHave you always admired beautiful handwriting and wanted to know how to achieve it? Then this beginner’s workshop is for you! Learn the basics of Copperplate Script, a type of calligraphy based on English Roundhand with a beautiful flow that is easy to learn. Your cards and invitations will take on a whole"
      }
