      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Saturdays | 8 weeks | Class skips October 12 and November 16\n\nDelve into the styles and techniques used by some of the most famous artists from around the world! In this class your young artist will learn how to recreate iconic artworks and how to put their own spin on these two-dimensional and three-dimensional pieces."
      }
