        "@value": "Saturdays | 8 weeks | Class skips October 12 and November 16\n\nTake an artistic voyage of discovery around the globe to learn about famous artists, their unique styles, and how they were inspired by the world around them. Discover how lines, shapes, and colours can be used to create vibrant and imaginative pieces. Students will"
