    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "  Thursdays | 8 weeks Develop the essentials of watercolour [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Materials List \n\n \n\nThursdays | 8 weeks\n\nDevelop the essentials of watercolour painting, including composition, brush work, and use of colour, all in a unique gallery setting. Discover the distinctive qualities of this beautiful medium while exploring a variety of approaches, such as still life and negative space in this fun and encouraging group atmosphere. Previous experience"
      }
    ],
