        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "NEW! Hand Building 101 - Aurora Cultural Centre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Wednesdays | 6 weeks  Get your hands messy and develop [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Wednesdays | 6 weeks \n\nGet your hands messy and develop the dexterity and skill needed for the fine art of pottery. Learn basic hand building techniques such as pinching, coiling, slab rolling, sculpting, carving and attaching in this beginner’s class. Discover how to use the skills learned in this course to create fun projects and unique"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
