      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Materials List \n\n \n\nTuesdays | 8 weeks\n\nA joyful introduction to the fundamentals of painting in acrylics while learning to see the shapes, colours, and values that create successful composition. Learn brush and paint selection, colour theory, and techniques to develop your personal style. With plenty of individual attention, students are able to work at their own"
      }
    ],
