        "@value": "September 23 | Monday | One-Day A full day of [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "September 23 | Monday | One-Day\n\nA full day of artistic adventures await! Unleash your creativity in the art studio, explore the galleries, and meet new friends in a fun and encouraging environment.\n\nSAVE! Register two children for one PA Day program and pay $40.00/ea"
      }
