        "@value": "Outer Space & Art Exploration (Ages 7 - 12) - Aurora Cultural Centre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Outer Space & Art Exploration! Blast off to outer space this week and get inspired by the cosmic colours of the galaxies. Soar through our solar system to create pieces inspired by the sun, the moon and the stars. Each week finishes with a student art exhibition for family & friends! All materials provided, including FREE camper t-shirt!  Outer Space & Art Exploration (Ages 7 - 12) Mixed Media Mashup camp runs August 12 - 16, from 1 pm - 4:30 pm daily."
      },
      {
