      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "This week, the studio transforms into an art lab! Campers will experiment with erupting watercolours, learn how gravity + marbles + paint = totally cool artwork, and discover the magic of fluid art. Each week finishes with a student art exhibition for family & friends!  Art Experiments (Ages 4-6) Young Artist Studio camp runs August 6 - 9 (short week), from 9 am - 12 pm daily."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
