        "@value": "article"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Globetrotting with Art (Ages 7 - 12) - Aurora Cultural Centre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Take a voyage of discovery around the globe to learn about famous artists, their unique styles, and how they were inspired by the world around them. Students will explore a variety of mediums such as acrylic paint, watercolours, and pastels.The session will end with an art show where students are invited to share their creativity and pieces with their families. All materials provided, including FREE camper t-shirt!  Globetrotting with Art (Ages 7 - 12) Mixed Media Mashup is a full day camp that runs July 29 - August 2, from 9 am - 4 pm daily."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Take a voyage of discovery around the globe to learn about famous artists, their unique styles, and how they were inspired by the world around them. Students will explore a variety of mediums such as acrylic paint, watercolours, and pastels.The session will end with an art show where students are invited to share their creativity"
      }
    ],
