        "@value": "Register \n\n \n\nWednesdays | 6 weeks | March 10 – April 14 | 6:15PM – 7:15PM \n\nWant to get happy? Learn to play the oh-so-hip ukulele! Come to this ground level introductory course – no musical theory required. You will learn all of the basics: the most commonly used chords, standard tuning, and simple strumming techniques. By"
