        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Register \n\nMaterials List \n\n \n\nSaturday | March 13 | 10:30AM – 12:30PM \n\nCalling all painting newbies – this workshop is for you! Call a friend (or two!) and spend the morning learning how to create a beautiful Springtime image in acrylic paint on canvas in a unique step-by-step virtual paint-along experience.\n\n$35.00 (HST Included) - Art Kit Included\n$25.00"
      }
    ],
