        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Centre-Pieces | Springing to Art: Equinox Edition - SOLD OUT\n\n \n\nImagining the colourful displays soon to bloom, this inaugural Centre-Piece tote is set with four activities embracing visual art with etching, craft, paper and watercolour painting. A season of hope and renewal, Spring 2021 will officially begin on Saturday March 20th with the vernal equinox. It"
