        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Please join the Aurora Cultural Centre Board of Directors for [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Please join the Aurora Cultural Centre Board of Directors for the Annual General Meeting of the not-for-profit charitable corporation.\n\nDue to COVID-19 safety measures, this event will take place digitally over Zoom Webinar. To attend the meeting, please register below. We look forward to welcoming you.\n\n \n\nRegister Here \n\n "
      }
