        "@value": "Art Olympics\nWEEK 5 | August 3-6*\n*Short week\n\nMixed Media Mashup | Ages 7 – 12 | 1:30 pm – 3:30 pm on Google Classroom | $80.00\n\nCelebrate the Olympics by taking a voyage of discovery around the globe to learn about how different artforms have been created around the world. Campers will gain insight into a variety"
