        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Centre-Pieces | Colour me Sunny: Solstice Edition Online pre-registration required; [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Centre-Pieces | Colour me Sunny: Solstice Edition\nSold Out \nOnline pre-registration required; limited quantities available; maximum of 2 totes per household\n \n\nMore sunshine = more time to create happy memories. We are delighted to announce our second Centre-Pieces tote – Colour Me Sunny: Solstice Edition, connected to the Summer Solstice and"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
