        "@value": "Register   Art Kit Info/Materials List \n\n \n\nSaturday, May 22 | One-Day | Virtual | Adults 16+ | 10:30 am - 12:30 pm\n\nCalling all painting newbies – this workshop is for you! Call a friend (or two!) and spend the morning learning how to create a beautiful image of cherry blossoms in acrylic paint on canvas"
