        "@value": "**REGISTRATION CLOSES WEDNESDAY, NOVEMBER 24 AT 4:00 PM**\n\nAbout the workshop:\n\nLooking to integrate Drama and The Arts curriculum into your class and other subject areas but don’t know where to start? Look no further! Created in partnership with MonAvenir, York Catholic District School Board, and York Region District School Board, in this two-hour virtual"
      }
    ],
