        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Meridian Magic Carpet Series Have you heard? There exists a [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Meridian Magic Carpet Series\nHave you heard?\nThere exists a river where instead of fish words are swimming and instead of waves there are sentences! It is a river whose currant brings all kind of stories, emotions, images, discoveries, friendships and more…\nA magic river where your imagination is surfing! Today – the river tells us of a"
      }
