        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Great Artist Music Series\nA brilliant young virtuoso of the classical guitar, Celil Refik Kaya brings flair and refinement to a program of Spanish, South American, and Eastern music. One of two three-time prizewinners of the Guitar Foundation of America International Guitar Competition, Kaya is the youngest First Prize Winner of the"
