        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Yamo! Yamo! Greetings from West Africa! - Aurora Cultural Centre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Kaleidoscope Family Series “Yamo! Yamo!” (“Hello! How are you doing!” in Baoulé) [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Kaleidoscope Family Series\n“Yamo! Yamo!” (“Hello! How are you doing!” in Baoulé) is the greeting from the charismatic ambassador of West African culture! In this dynamic and interactive performance, Fana Soro, a hereditary master musician of the Senoufo people, shares the musical traditions of his home country to showcase the soaring melodies, driving rhythms and use of percussion"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://auroraculturalcentre.ca/event/yamo-yamo-greetings-from-west-africa/"
      }
    ],
