        "@value": "Cinderella in Muddy York - Aurora Cultural Centre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A family holiday show. Cinderella reimagined in marionette theatre, and adapted for a show Canadian children can call all their own."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Kaleidoscope Family Series\nHistory and pure fun are integrated in this imaginative retelling of the much loved classic fairy tale - guaranteed to delight all ages for the holidays! Set in 1834 Upper Canada, just as “Muddy” York is to be renamed Toronto, Ella is a kind and capable young girl whose good nature is imposed"
      }
    ],
