        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Favourite storybook characters The Berenstain Bears take to the stage!"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "This event has been cancelled due to COVID-19. For more information visit our dedicated COVID-19 webpage. We apologize for the inconvenience and thank you for your understanding.\nMeridian Magic Carpet Series\nAn action-packed adventure featuring some of the most renowned storybook bears of all time! Told through live music, songs and dance, and adapted from five"
      }
