        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "This event has been cancelled due to COVID-19. For more information visit our dedicated COVID-19 webpage. We apologize for the inconvenience and thank you for your understanding.\n\n \nMeridian Magic Carpet Series\nTaama – “Journey” in the Dioula language of Burkina Faso – brings together a Burkinabe singer and a Breton violinist in a colourful world that"
      }
    ],
