        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Bombadils Keepin’ It Cozy Live online from their comfy [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Bombadils\nKeepin' It Cozy\nLive online from their comfy Halifax home studio\n1 pm EST live stream\nThe live stream event has begun. Ticket sales are now closed. Please visit the Event Calendar on our website for more upcoming events and performances.\nRBC Emerging Artist Series\nCanadian Folk Music Award nominees The"
      }
