      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Tango in the Dark | Special Zoom Artist Reception\nApril 10 | 7:30 pm EDT\n\nJoin us in the Zoom Room as we welcome members of Pointe Tango and the Payadora Tango Ensemble for a relaxed and informative discussion/Q&A on the making of this film. It’s a fascinating journey from a planned live performance, to a digital"
      }
