        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Arts Talk Series #1 Free Event The effects of arts [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Register \nArts Talk Series #1\nFree Event\n\nThe effects of arts education on a child’s mental health is vital at the best of times. Over the past year, in-school arts programs have either been drastically scaled back or temporarily eliminated due to health and safety guidelines. Join the Aurora Cultural Centre and a panel of"
      }
