        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Kattam and his Tam-Tams Kaleidoscope Family Series 2:00 pm Virtual [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Kattam and his Tam-Tams\nKaleidoscope Family Series\n2:00 pm Virtual Concert\nLivestream available February 21 at 2:00 pm until February 28, 2022 at 2:00 pm\n \nTo the sound of the n’goni, balafon, djembe, naffar, derbouka and dhol, Montreal-based percussionist Kattam invites you to discover Africa, the Middle"
      }
    ],
