        "@value": "The Ennis Sisters | A Concert From Home Wednesday, March [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Ennis Sisters | A Concert From Home\nWednesday, March 17\n7:30 pm EDT\n$15 (HST incl)\n\nBuy Ticket \n\n \n\nThe Ennis Sisters present a pre-recorded concert made especially for the Aurora Cultural Centre, from their home community of St. John’s, Newfoundland.\n\nSisters Maureen, Karen and Teresa have made 2 previous sold-out appearances at the Centre, becoming fan favourites in the"
      }
