    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "John Sheard Presents A Heat Wave – The Hottest Legends [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "John Sheard Presents\nA Heat Wave - The Hottest Legends of Motown\nSignature Series\nPostponed Until Fall \n\nPricing\n**22% Off in '22!** - Special Discounted pricing available.  Select tickets under the \"22% Off in '22!\" when purchasing!\n\nLive In-Person: $50.00 (HST included) \n\n \nThe classics from Motown have endured for good"
      }
    ],
