      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Artistic Imaginations\nWEEK 2 | July 11 - 15\n\nMixed Media Mashup | Ages 7 – 12 | 1:30 pm - 4:30 pm | $110.00\n\nThis week is all about fantasy, myths and legends. Campers will discover how to create cool art pieces based on unicorns, dragons, mermaids, monsters, and so much more! This whimsical week will be"
      }
