        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The exhibition She Flourishes; Creating a Vision for a Peaceful [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The exhibition She Flourishes; Creating a Vision for a Peaceful World is a conversation about women’s qualities and leadership in today’s world, and how women have the powerful potential to transform. Feminine intrinsic qualities of intuition, compassion, inclusiveness, interconnectedness that have been marginalized for centuries are now rising to their full expression and are shaping"
      }
