      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Submission deadline: Monday, November 11, 2019 by 11:00pm\n\nPlease pay a non-refundable fee of $40 by clicking the \"Artist Submission Fee\" button below.\n\nCurious Minds exhibition and sale: November 29, 2019 to January 25, 2020\n\nFor more details on the exhibition, please visit Curious Minds.\n\nARTIST SUBMISSION FEE"
      }
    ],
