      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Members of the Society of York Region Artists explore curiosity on many levels – whether it is being curious about colour and colour combinations, new forms of artwork, or being curious about capturing the beauty of ordinary moments. Curious Minds will inspire those to learn, wonder, and grow.  Have the opportunity to purchase your very own original"
      }
