        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join us in Red Gallery as we celebrate the Curious Minds artist reception, as this exhibition will be the Society of York Region Artists’ 2nd Annual Juried Exhibition & Sale.\n\nLight refreshments will be available for your enjoyment.\n\nAll welcome.\n\n \n\nExhibition Details\n\nMembers of the Society of York Region Artists explore curiosity on many levels in this exciting exhibition Curious Minds– whether"
