        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A Showcase of Aurora's Class of 2020 Visual and Performing Artists"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Since 2011, the Aurora Cultural Centre has engaged graduating Grade 12 youth artists in the community to showcase their talents and achievements at the Mayor's Celebration of Youth Arts.  Don’t miss this opportunity to celebrate the next generation of visual and performing artists in our community. Witness their fresh and invigorating perspectives!\n\nThe Visual Arts exhibition"
      }
