        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Aurora's high school performing art students share their talents with us centre stage! Please join us as we celebrate their accomplishments. Performances showcase music, theatre, spoken word and more will demonstrate the amazing talents of these young adults. Don’t miss it!\n\n \nDescription\nSince 2011, the Aurora Cultural Centre has engaged graduating Grade 12 youth artists in the"
      }
    ],
