    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "We’re Facebook Live today! What’s it like to create an [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "We're Facebook Live today!\n\nWhat's it like to create an exhibition in the midst of a global pandemic? Tune in today and find out from the perspective of Beyond the Walls | Uxbridge Artist Collective Exhibition and Sale Co-curators Carmel Brennan (Uxbridge Artist Collective) and Clare Bolton (Aurora Cultural Centre). A lively Facebook Live interactive event,"
      }
    ],
