      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Enhance your gallery experience with activities and videos! We invite you to join us for an insider look into the creative process. Art Bytes is an online series that includes conversations with the exhibiting artists, behind-the-scene videos and family friendly art demos. Visit our Art Bytes page for current videos and activities.\n\n \n\nArt Bytes | In"
      }
