        "@value": "Student Art Exhibition\nSat March 6 –  Sat May 1, 2021\n\n \n\nExhibition Description:\n\nEnjoy this celebration of the next generation of visual artists in our community and be sure to check #MCOYA21 on Instagram! For an insider look at the creative process, you can catch our final Arts Bytes video for this exhibition which premieres Thursday, April 15"
