        "@value": "Enhance your gallery experience with Art Bytes! Art Bytes is an online series that includes conversations with the artists, behind-the-scene videos, and a limited run performance video.\n\n \n\nArt Bytes | Welcome to MCOYA 2021\n\nWatch Art Byte \n\n \n\nWelcome to the Mayor’s Celebration of Youth Arts, celebrating Aurora’s Class of 2021. We’re delighted to welcome Town of Aurora"
