      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Behind the Scenes of The Conversation\n\nNow that you’ve seen the art installation, get a behind the scenes look at how this exhibition all came together in the Aurora Town Hall’s pristine second floor gallery space. Get an insider look into what it takes to get the work up on the walls… and the floor!\n\nArt Byte"
      }
