        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join us for our quarterly public board meeting. The meeting [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join us for our quarterly public board meeting.\n\nThe meeting will be taking place at the Aurora Public Library on the second floor! Doors for entrance will open at 6:15PM.  Enter from the Yonge Street doors.\n\nTo attend the meeting, please register by clicking the button below\n\nRegister Here \n\nWe look forward to welcoming you."
      }
