      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Now Streaming: Future Artists!\nWEEK 9 | August 28 - September 1\n\nMixed Media Mashup | Ages 7 – 12 | 9:00 am - 4:00 pm | $260.00\n\nLights! Camera! Action!  Learn how to tell your character's story through visual art.  Campers will take inspiration from their favourite movie characters, and create their own, using various art materials"
