        "@value": "Famous Artists & Their Styles\nWEEK 8 | August 21 - 25\n\nMixed Media Mashup | Ages 7 – 12 | 9:00 am - 4:00 pm | $260.00\n\nDelve into the styles and techniques used by some of the most famous artists in history. From da Vinci to Dali, campers will learn about various mediums and experiment with"
