        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Register Here \n\n \n\nWednesdays | 8 weeks | 6:30 pm – 7:45 pm | April 19 - June 7 | 16+\n\nWant to get happy? Learn to play the oh-so-hip ukulele! Come to this ground level introductory course – no musical theory required. You will learn all of the basics: the most commonly used chords, standard"
