        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Register Here \n\nSunday, May 28 | One-Day | Adults 16+ | 10:00 am - 1:00 pm\n\nEveryone is invited to our May paint-along event! Whether you're an artist or just someone looking to try something new, this event is for you. Our experienced artist and art instructor Kimberley will guide you through creating a beautiful painting"
