        "@value": "Join us for our quarterly public board meeting.\n\nThe meeting will be taking place at the Aurora Town Hall on the second floor! Doors for entrance will open at 6:15PM.  Enter from the main doors.\n\nTo attend the meeting, please register by clicking the button below\n\nRegister Here \n\n \n\nWe look forward to welcoming you."
