        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Ages 16+ | Sunday | February 25, 2024 | 10:00 [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Register Here \n\n \n\nAges 16+ | Sunday | February 25, 2024 | 10:00 am - 4:00 pm\n\nJoin our one-day wood carving workshop, perfect for beginners and seasoned carvers alike. Dive into the art of carving in a supportive and inspiring environment, with a special Easter-inspired twist to elevate your creative experience!  If you have carving"
      }
