      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "March Break Crafternoon\n11:00 - 2:00pm\nNC Aurora Armoury\n89 Mosley Street, Aurora\n \nWe’re exploring upcycling and environmental stewardship through art with a free create-and-take workshop for all ages! Embrace the upcoming spring as we delve into hands-on crafting activities, using recycled"
      }
