      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Artist-Poet Gathering\nSaturday, January 18 | 11 am - 1 pm\nHomeroom Galleries (Level 1), 50 Victoria Street\n \n\nJoin us for our Winter Artist-Poet Gathering! \n\nGatherings are dependent on the exhibitions on-view at Aurora Cultural Centre’s public galleries. For this January 18 gathering, exhibitions include Seven Masters in Homeroom"
      }
    ],
