      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Pricing\nLive In-Person: $40.00 (HST included)\nTickets \nUp Close and Musical Package: Choose 3 or more shows (excluding family shows) and save 15%!  Must be done within the same transaction, discount provided at checkout. \n\n \nAurora Cultural Centre Presents\nDanny Michel"
