      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Monday, May 12, 2025\nHomeroom Gallery 1\n6:30-7:30PM\n$18 per registrant (ages 13+)(Click to register now!)\n \n\nJoin Meghan and Dana in Homeroom Galleries for yoga, meditation, and a sound bath surrounded by the fantastical sculptures of Montreal-based artists Laurence Vallieres.  \n\n$18.00 entry fee is required,"
      }
