      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Sabzeh\nOpening Night\nThursday, August 14, 6:30 - 8:30 pm\nHomeroom Galleries (Level 1) | 50 Victoria Street, Aurora\n \n\nThe Aurora Cultural Centre is thrilled to unveil an immersive exhibition by Parisa Sabet and Laura Friedmann with contributing artists. This exhibition is inspired by Persian rugs and growing sprouts, featuring a blend of"
