        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "September 27 | 12:00 – 3:30 PM Lower Hall Gallery [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "September 27 | 12:00 - 3:30 PM\nLower Hall Gallery @ 12 | Brevik Hall @ 2\n \nJoin us at Aurora Town Square for National Day for Truth and Reconciliation!\nReflecting upon the National Day for Truth and Reconciliation, Mohawk-Ojibwe artist Sharon Rigby shares the stories of Indigenous individuals impacted by the residential"
      }
