      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Expanded Collage\nwith Julia Mobbs\nOctober 4, 1:00 - 4:00 pm\nArt Activity Room (Level B1) | 50 Victoria Street, Aurora\n \n\nGet creative with our Fall Artist-in-Residence, Julia Mobbs! \n\nExplore the origins of collage and scrapbooking by making your own template-free art piece. Using collage in her art since high school, Mobbs"
      }
    ],
