      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Sunday, September 21 | 10:00 - 4:00 PM\nShining Hill Visual Arts Studio & Art Activity Room\nCome and explore Aurora's unique built heritage and vibrant cultural spaces during Doors Open 2025. From Aurora Town Square to Hillary House, Oddfellows Lodge and more, enjoy behind-the-scenes access and special programming. Discover local history, art"
      }
