        "@value": "Pricing\nRegular: $30.00 (HST included)\nStudent: $15.00 (HST included - ID Required at entry)\nTickets Sold Out \nMix & Match Subscription Package: Choose 3 or more ACC shows (excluding family shows) and save 15%!  Must be done within the same transaction, discount provided at checkout.\nGreat Artist Music Series"
