      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Brandon Baghaee ... in-studio!\n\nFREE | February 16, 2026 | 11:00 AM - 1:00 PM\nArt Activity Room (Level B1) | 50 Victoria Street, Aurora\n \n\nDrop in and say hello to ACC Winter Artist-in-Residence, Brandon Baghaee, at work in the Art Activity Room"
      }
