        "@value": "Closing Talk with Jing Fu Unearthed: My Equilibrium Wednesday, August [...]"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Closing Talk with Jing Fu\nUnearthed: My Equilibrium\nWednesday, August 12, 2026 | 7:00 pm\nHomeroom Gallery (Level 1) | 50 Victoria Street, Aurora\n \n\nJoin Interim Gallery Manager in conversation with Jing Fu, the solo artist of Unearthed: My Equilibrium, exhibited in Homeroom Galleries from May 14 – August 13, 2026.\n\nAll ages are welcome"
      }
    ],
