        "@value": "Pricing\nRegular: $25.00 (HST included)\nStudent: $15.00 (HST included - ID Required at entry)\nTickets On Sale \nFamily Package: Get 4 tickets for the price of 3!  Discount provided at checkout. \n\n \nAurora Cultural Centre Presents\nFireside Munsch\nAurora Town Square"
      }
    ],
